{
  "//": [
    "Template for .claude/launch.json — the actual file is gitignored.",
    "Copy this to .claude/launch.json and fill in the env vars you need locally.",
    "",
    "VAPID keys: needed only if you want push reminders to work in dev.",
    "Generate a dev keypair (different from production):",
    "  bundle exec ruby -rweb-push -e 'k = WebPush.generate_key; puts \"PUB=#{k.public_key}\"; puts \"PRV=#{k.private_key}\"'",
    "",
    "Without the env vars, /notifications renders the 'aren't configured yet' branch."
  ],
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "configurations": [
    {
      "name": "Rails server",
      "runtimeExecutable": "sh",
      "runtimeArgs": [
        "-c",
        "VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY='REPLACE-WITH-DEV-VAPID-PUB' VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY='REPLACE-WITH-DEV-VAPID-PRV' bin/rails server -p 3000"
      ],
      "port": 3000
    }
  ]
}
